cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use the Latch Benchmark Suite, please cite it as below."
title: "Latch Benchmark Suite (LBS)"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "iome-sh contributors"
    website: "https://github.com/iome-sh"
repository-code: "https://github.com/iome-sh/latch-benchmark"
license: Apache-2.0
abstract: >
  Benchmark suite for in-process robot mode-election planes.
  Measures whether the elected mode is repeatable, whether the name
  chatters, how long consider takes, and whether a session can be replayed.
  Yield means the mode leaves the setpoint. It is not a protective stop
  and not a rated stop.
  This is not a grasp-success suite, a SIL or ISO pack, or a behavior tree.
keywords:
  - robotics
  - mode-election
  - benchmarks
  - mujoco
  - ros2
  - validation
# version / date-released: fill when first public release tags
